<title>FRANCE: French Oct official reserves 303.84 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>French Oct official reserves 303.84 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France and finance ministry gave the following breakdown of offical gold and foreign exchange reserves (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					  Oct    Sept</p>
<p> Total reserves		   303.839  303.685</p>
<p> Gold				 164.814  164.814</p>
<p> Ecu				   51.352   55.849</p>
<p> Foreign exchange		  68.700   64.047</p>
<p> Credits with IMF		  18.973   18.975</p>
